## 3. Internet Connection and Servers

Technology Store Simulator does not require an Internet connection for its core gameplay functionality.

The Application does not use an online server to store game saves or collect user information.

Information generated by the local save system remains on the user's device and is not transmitted to HorozGame or any third-party server.

